      Open the bag, select the <b>Hanger</b> and press <b>Dismantle</b> — not Examine, not Use. The hanger bends out into a length of stiff wire with a hook on the end and the label changes to <b>Hook</b>. This is the verb most players never press in this level, and it is the reason a lot of people get as far as the burnt grate and stop: they are carrying the hanger, they can see the key, and the game keeps refusing the item because it is still a hanger.
