      Still in the bag: select the <b>Blowtorch</b>, press <b>Combine</b> and tap the <b>Lighter</b>. The two slots merge into one item labelled <b>Lit blowtorch</b>: a yellow canister with a grey handle and a blue flame already burning at the nozzle. It stays lit in the bag for the rest of the level, which is a small mercy — there is no second lighter and no way to put it out by accident. From here on, whenever the game asks you for heat, this is the item it wants.
