      The lid comes up on a tray of ordinary tools and the crowbar lying across them. Pick it up and the game puts it in the bag with its own label. There is no puzzle to solve with it and no obvious target in the back room — which is the point. The crowbar is for the floor. Everything in this room that could hide something has already been opened except the boards under your feet.
      <img src="/rooms-and-exits/c2l11-crowbar-toolbox.jpg" alt="The open green toolbox with the crowbar lying inside on the tray" width="1200" height="594" loading="lazy" />
